# Controls: one game, every kind of input.
# Move with the arrows, WASD, a gamepad d-pad, or the gamepad's left stick.
# Phones and tablets get on-screen buttons.
# Dash with space, shift, gamepad A, or the right mouse button while moving.
# Pop targets by touching them, or by clicking them with the mouse.
# Open the Console and Input tabs under the game to watch it all happen.

game
  size 320 by 180
  background dark slate gray
  touch buttons

control go-left
  left key
  a key
  gamepad left

control go-right
  right key
  d key
  gamepad right

control go-up
  up key
  w key
  gamepad up

control go-down
  down key
  s key
  gamepad down

control start-over
  escape key
  gamepad start

control dash
  space key
  shift key
  gamepad a
  right mouse

pops starts at 0

thing player
  looks like aquamarine box 10 by 10
  starts at 155, 85
  solid

thing edge-across
  looks like slate gray box 320 by 4
  starts at 0, 0
  starts at 0, 176
  solid
  fixed

thing edge-down
  looks like slate gray box 4 by 180
  starts at 0, 0
  starts at 316, 0
  solid
  fixed

thing target
  looks like tomato circle 6

when go-left is held
  move player left 2
when go-right is held
  move player right 2
when go-up is held
  move player up 2
when go-down is held
  move player down 2

# The stick gives a number from -1 to 1, so it can move at any speed.
always
  move player right gamepad stick x * 3
  move player down gamepad stick y * 3

when dash is pressed and go-left is held
  move player left 24
when dash is pressed and go-right is held
  move player right 24
when dash is pressed and go-up is held
  move player up 24
when dash is pressed and go-down is held
  move player down 24

when every 1.5 seconds
  make a target at random 20 to 290, random 20 to 150

when player touches target
  remove the target
  add 1 to pops
  log "touched a target, {pops} popped"

when mouse is clicked on the target
  remove the target
  add 1 to pops
  log "clicked a target, {pops} popped"

when mouse is over the target
  log "aiming at a target"

when start-over is pressed
  restart game

when any key is pressed and pops is 0
  log "a key was pressed"

always
  show text "Pops: {pops}" at 6, 14
  show text "Keys, mouse, gamepad or touch" at 8, 164 in light gray
